meta {
  name: The session of one date (trading day or not, and the times)
  type: http
  seq: 8
}

get {
  url: {{baseUrl}}/v1/calendar/sessions
  body: none
  auth: bearer
}

params:query {
  ~exchange: NSE
  ~date: 2026-10-27
}

auth:bearer {
  token: {{apiKey}}
}

docs {
  The session of one date (trading day or not, and the times)

  - An API key with the `read` scope (any key).

  Whether the date is a trading day and why not when it is not (weekend, holiday), the pre-open, open and close
  times (IST), a special session such as Muhurat trading, and the neighbouring trading days. The standard hours are
  marked `sessionTimes.verified: false`: the Bridge has not confirmed them against a current circular.

  Reference: docs/api/market-data/getCalendarSessions.md in the repository.
}
